window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Space is incomprehensibly large, mysterious, and mesmerizing. It is full of secrets and wonders beyond imaginable. It puts you to the test to reveal the good and evil in your soul, which you didn’t know existed. Space occupations are not the job but the call of stars you can’t ignore.</p> <p>This book will introduce you to the alternative near future of the world of Sonya and Terah through the stories of Romeo, the guy who dreams of becoming a long-range space pilot, and Jill Abbot, the nurse from Earth who thought she scored a high-paying easy gig on the moon when everything didn’t go as expected.</p> <p>Buckle up and enjoy the ride.</p> <p>Thank you for choosing my book.</p> <p>Sincerely, Iaroslav (surfcj) Dombrovskyi.</p>"; 
